WEBVTT

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:26.130
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:32.990
The Underworld.

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.250
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.430
A world without light.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:44.880
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:46.350
Yes, indeed.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:52.500
The Tribunal of Silence

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.970
This is the First Prison.

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:01.850
It reads, Judgment House.

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.270
But those in the Underworld are already dead.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:09.630
What do they judge here?

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:23.110
It's so quiet here.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.580
Don't talk.

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:31.750
Who is it?

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:34.460
Quiet.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:36.850
I said to be quiet.

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:40.560
This is the Judgment House
where silence is required.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:47.130
Especially Lord René, who is stepping
in for Lord Minos, detests noise.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.140
Seiya?

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.330
Seiya.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:03.180
Maybe I caught a cold after
falling into the river.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:06.880
Fool! Didn't you hear what I said?

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:09.300
You're louder than I am.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:14.910
Anyway, once you enter the court

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:18.030
you must confess all your sins to Lord René.

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:20.510
Huh? What did you say?

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.970
You're going to trial.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:23.930
What?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.310
I said...

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:26.540
Silence!

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:32.250
Marchino, I told you there
shall be silence in court,

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.360
do you not understand?

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.390
Yes. I'm sorry, Lord René.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.280
That man is René.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.340
The Specter of the First Prison.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:51.070
I could hear your ruckus
from the waiting room.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:53.490
No, that wasn't me.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.840
Quiet.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.230
Enough. You are dismissed.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:04.900
If I hear you raise your voice
again, you are finished.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:08.590
Yes, I'm very sorry.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.920
I am Barlon René,

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.830
presiding over the court of the Underworld

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.530
on behalf of Minos.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.040
I will now examine your past sins,

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.800
and send you to an appropriate hell.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:31.950
Now, state your name and
honestly confess your sins.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.730
I'm Seiya.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:35.090
I'm Shun.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:41.430
We haven't done anything so
bad that we be judged in hell.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:42.760
Silence!

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.100
Lower your voice.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.680
There's no point in lying
because you're afraid.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.190
Everything is in the file.

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:55.770
What's this?

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:00.270
There must be some mistake.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.660
Your sins are not in the file.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.940
State your name once again.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:10.730
All right, I'll say it
clearly so you won't forget.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:11.310
What?

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.400
Listen carefully.

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:22.120
I am Athena's Saint, Pegasus Seiya!

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.050
And this is Andromeda Shun!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.990
We've awakened to our Eighth Sense

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.980
and come here to defeat Hades!

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:34.600
Do you understand?

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.630
Seiya.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:47.860
I see. I understand.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:52.040
Lord René, there's trouble!

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:57.090
Athena's Saints have
crossed the Acheron River!

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.550
And made it into the First Prison!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:01.920
Silence.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.950
How many times do I have to say it?

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:11.230
I'm sorry, but it's an emergency.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:14.600
I promise I'll be quiet.

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:18.310
Never again, never again.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:29.500
I see. If you're not
dead, you're not on file.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:34.830
Fine. In that case,

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:39.210
I'll make you confess all your sins.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.180
Then I'll send you to an appropriate hell.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.380
Alive.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:48.000
Send us to hell alive?

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:53.040
Now, I will look at all the
bad things you have done.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:58.450
I told you, we haven't done
anything so bad to be judged!

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.160
We'll see.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:01.470
Seiya.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.500
Reincarnation!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:14.960
Seiya.

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:19.950
What's this light?

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:26.630
All the evil you have committed

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.300
is discharging from your body.

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:30.700
Huh?

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:39.630
My childhood memories are surfacing.

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:43.150
I killed insects for fun.

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.530
And I picked flowers for no reason.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.450
That's not all.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.370
There's still more.

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.250
This and that!

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:07.840
So, do you still maintain your innocence?

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.340
However...

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:13.720
Your biggest sin

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:17.810
is the violence and injury you inflicted
on a countless number of people.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:35.920
Seiya.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:41.770
You're wrong. It's true I
have defeated many enemies.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.250
But it was all in the name of justice!

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:45.880
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:50.800
Mortals do not have the
right to punish one another.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:57.150
There's a hell well-suited
for violent people like you.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.100
You shall be sent into that hell alive!

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:05.520
Now, off to the First Valley
of the Sixth Prison!

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:08.350
Seiya.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.210
The First Valley of the Sixth Prison

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.240
is an ocean of blood.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:21.510
Where violent people who wounded others go.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:27.360
Suffer forever in the bubbling sea of blood.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:31.020
Pegasus Seiya, your skin will burn
and your flesh will dissolve.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:32.880
Repent your sins as a skeleton!

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:41.550
What?

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:46.230
He pulled Pegasus back up.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.740
What is that chain?

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:54.250
The Andromeda Chain can
travel light years away.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.870
I won't let Seiya or anyone
else fall into hell.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.580
Could it be? Are you...

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:11.240
No. If I look closely, the
hair color is different.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:17.300
It's not him. There's no way he
can come to a place like this.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.490
However, the resemblance is uncanny.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.690
It's the spitting image of him.

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:23.940
What are you talking about?

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.240
Andromeda, right?

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:31.480
It looks like you've hurt
a lot of people, too.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.270
But that's...

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:37.720
No excuses. This whip will determine
the degree of your sins.

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:39.920
My Barlon Whip!

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.490
Nebula Chain!

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:48.540
So you also deny your sins and retaliate.

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:52.360
It's true we've hurt many people

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.900
in the name of justice.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:11:00.820
I am prepared to pay for
those sins when I die.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.780
But, just as you said,

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:09.230
is there ever a person who
never commits a single sin?

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.470
What?

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:16.280
The gentlest person will have to
harm animals and plants to survive.

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:20.570
He will hold grudges, hate and hurt others.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:24.610
But nobody wants to do those things.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:31.530
If you still think humans are evil,
then that means life itself is evil.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:37.390
Do you really think so? Tell me.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:41.610
Unfortunately, the only one
who can answer that is God.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:47.400
I am only here to judge for the Underworld.

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:50.020
Guilty or not guilty!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:51.350
Wait.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:56.210
However, once you are here,
it means you are not innocent.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.370
Fire Whip!

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.520
Rolling Defense!

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:07.090
It's no use! There is no defense
against the whip's judgment.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.590
Barlon's whip wraps itself around a sinner

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:15.470
to gauge their level of sin.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:17.230
Look at your body.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:20.650
This is all your past sins.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:24.420
Do you still believe your fight is righteous?

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:28.600
I...

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:31.000
Even if the opponent is an enemy,

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:37.480
I always end up hurting them, even
if I don't want to hurt anyone.

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:42.530
I wonder how many people
I will hurt in the future.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:49.480
Perhaps my existence means that
someone will always get hurt.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:55.110
If that's the case, I...

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:58.680
It seems you have surrendered.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.880
Be condemned into the
Sixth Prison with Pegasus.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:05.860
But with your body already cut in pieces.

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:12.990
Seiya, Hyoga, Shiryu, brother, I'm sorry.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:16.880
Perhaps I am tired of fighting.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.110
The court is adjourned.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.880
I pity them.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:35.680
Even as my enemy, they possessed pure hearts.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:41.290
But they rose up against Lord Hades,

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.910
so they were rightfully sent to hell.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:48.670
However, Andromeda looked just like him.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:55.030
It's upsetting that it seemed
like I just ended his life.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:56.060
René.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:56.850
This voice?

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:58.530
Could it be?

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.870
René.

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:03.550
How could you ravage my body?

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:04.970
You fool!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:10.310
Lord! Then that was...

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:14.060
Now restore my body!

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:14.960
Yes, immediately.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:17.500
His body!

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:20.510
His body is gone.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:25.590
What have I done?

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:29.590
I cut his body into pieces!

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:35.840
Somebody! Somebody find his body!

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.660
Was it blown away by the Black Hurricane

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.900
to the Black Valley?

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:44.910
Where's his body?

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:49.600
Where's the rest?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:52.690
What's wrong, René?

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.470
Rhadamanthys.

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:57.330
This head...

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.060
Head?

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.920
What are you talking about?

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:03.920
What is this?

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:05.980
Seiya.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:07.410
Seiya, get a hold of yourself.

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:08.460
Shun.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.070
Where's the enemy, René?

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:13.840
He's gone.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:17.990
I thought he got me, too, but
as you can see, I'm fine.

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:21.430
What happened?

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.560
This is my mask.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:30.290
Does this mean that this was all an illusion?

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:35.040
Damn that Andromeda and his childish game.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.480
No, you're wrong.

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:40.780
The Bronze Saints don't have the ability

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:43.010
to fool a Specter like you.

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:44.090
What did you say?

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:48.240
A much more fearsome man
has entered the Underworld.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.740
Impossible! Are you saying this man

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:55.440
attacked me before I got Andromeda?

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:57.300
Who is this man?

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:02.530
He's here. He's nearby.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:07.530
How dare he ridicule us in our domain.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.590
There!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.070
I got you!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:17.680
Once you're wrapped in Barlon's
whip, you cannot escape.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.170
Reveal yourself.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:26.020
Fine. If you insist.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.870
Just as I suspected.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.710
The man who once fooled God.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.470
Gemini Canon!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:44.020
I hoped my Delusion attack would
make René lead me to Hades.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:45.890
No matter.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:50.270
This time I'll ask Rhadamanthys to take me.

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:54.780
Fool. Your body is just
about to be dismembered.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:58.260
Dismembered? That is what will happen to you.

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.070
What's this?

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:05.340
Instead of Canon, it's my whip
that is turning into dust!

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.980
No, it's not just the whip.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.800
Impossible! Even my body.

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:22.000
You said none other than God
has the right to punish others.

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:24.260
This is a punishment from God.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:26.100
You brought this upon yourself.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:30.240
Will you suffer the same
punishment, Rhadamanthys?

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:34.490
Or will you take me to Hades?

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:38.900
Of course I will take you. But only to hell!

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.580
My body feels light.

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:48.270
Hades' energy isn't present here.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:53.790
Obviously. Only the dead and
powerless pass through here.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:56.690
There's no need to defend against enemies.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:18:02.690
Then this won't be like how
it was in Hades' Castle,

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.400
where you fought Milo and Aioria.

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:11.820
Are you saying I was only able to defeat
Mu because of the circumstances?

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.200
There's no other explanation.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:17.410
There's no way those two could
have been defeated so easily.

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:22.460
I'll show you a Gold Saint's true strength.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:25.440
Canon.

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:28.050
It was you, Canon. You saved us.

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:32.560
It's great to have a Saint
of your caliber on our side.

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:36.590
When did I ever say I was on your side?

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:41.670
But didn't you repent your
sins and pledge to Athena?

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.980
What are you doing, Canon?

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:53.580
It's true, I pledged to Athena.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.360
But I don't remember becoming your ally.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.610
What?

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:06.200
Sentimental fools will only slow me down.

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:07.570
Canon.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:12.720
Never complain about being
tired in the battlefield.

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.840
Don't hesitate with the
enemy in front of you.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:22.180
Unless you defeat the enemy, more
innocent victims will be hurt.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:23.400
Canon.

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:30.820
I was once tainted with evil,
so I'm in no position to talk.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:36.780
But if it is a sin to wound the enemy,

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:40.820
then I'll receive God's judgment
after all evil is banished.

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.240
I will continue to fight until that day.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:44.400
Canon.

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:46.240
If you understand, go on ahead.

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:51.190
Don't forget you have something
important to deliver to Athena.

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:53.140
Seiya.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:53.920
All right.

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.650
We're going ahead, Canon.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:06.400
It's difficult to hear a lecture
from someone who deceived Poseidon.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:12.350
Now, show me the true strength
of a Gold Saint you boast about.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:15.640
What's wrong, Canon?

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:18.190
You can't get away from my Black Hurricane.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.360
You'll either fall into hell

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.450
or die by my hands. It's one or the other.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:25.000
Take this!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:27.150
Greatest Caution!

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:38.650
As expected, the stronger
one out of the 108 Specters.

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:42.090
One of the big three, Wyvern Rhadamanthys.

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:46.350
Your realization is too late. Die, Canon!

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:52.740
Wh-What was that?

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.560
M-My body won't move!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:21:00.360
The Delusion attack I used on René
earlier just made him see illusions.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:04.830
However, this legendary attack
is much more than that.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:09.540
Those hit with the attack will never awaken,
unless they kill their target.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:10.360
Wha...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:13.340
Now... Let's have you lead me to Hades.

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.110
I-Impossible.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:20.010
Are you going to try to make
me kill Lord Hades myself?

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:23.390
That would make things much easier for me.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.370
But don't worry.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:29.670
This attack just affected your senses,

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.180
only making you incapable
of moving for a short while.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.430
I have yet to cast the
Demon King Illusion Fist.

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:40.520
Behold! Demon King Illusion Fist!

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:50.170
What are you doing here?

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:55.690
Miss Pandora sent us. She requests
your presence at the Cocytus.

00:21:55.690 --> 00:22:00.590
Nonsense. Taking care of
intruding Saints is a priority.

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:06.470
Yes, but Miss Pandora has been
waiting and is losing her patience.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:08.210
Fine.

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:13.180
We will remain here and finish Canon.

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.340
Don't bother.

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:19.390
Even if there were a few hundred
of you, you can't beat him.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:22.810
Canon, we'll finish this soon.

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:28.740
Now, will you surrender

00:22:28.810 --> 00:22:32.380
or take us all on and die?

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:37.210
Are you ignoring Rhadamanthys' advice?

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:38.160
What?

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:40.910
Even if there were a few hundred
of you, there's no way.

00:22:41.180 --> 00:22:43.630
Get out of my sight if you want to live.

00:22:44.390 --> 00:22:45.360
Ridiculous.

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:47.270
Shut that big mouth!

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:49.520
Do it if you can.

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:54.380
Do you want to see stars explode?

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:00.940
Galaxian Explosion!

00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:12.940
Canon.

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:17.390
What's that light?

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:18.410
Let's go, Hyoga!

00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:24.690
Farewell.

00:24:58.470 --> 00:24:59.440
The Second Prison...

00:24:59.640 --> 00:25:03.240
The guard dog of Hell, Cerberus,
mercilessly devours all of the sinners.

00:25:03.840 --> 00:25:05.920
A Specter plays a melody,

00:25:05.920 --> 00:25:08.550
and its cursed melody steals away the Saints' ability to move.

00:25:08.850 --> 00:25:12.660
When our souls were about to disappear,
a melody resonates from another lyre.

00:25:12.660 --> 00:25:14.820
A beautiful yet sad melody.

00:25:15.160 --> 00:25:18.090
Saint Seiya: "The Legendary Saint Orphée,"

00:25:18.150 --> 00:25:20.260
and "Orphée, The Sad Requiem."

00:25:20.520 --> 00:25:23.400
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
